WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.122
Bumble bit his lip.

2
00:00:06.123 --> 00:00:08.997
"What if Feather is right?

3
00:00:08.998 --> 00:00:14.241
What if Emma is a fairy hunter?"

4
00:00:14.242 --> 00:00:16.465
Sprite shook her head.

5
00:00:16.466 --> 00:00:18.700
"It doesn't matter.

6
00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:22.752
Our job is to grant birthday wishes."

7
00:00:22.753 --> 00:00:28.697
Feather frowned. "Even dangerous ones?"

8
00:00:28.698 --> 00:00:34.661
Hob rolled his eyes.

9
00:00:34.662 --> 00:00:40.355
"Emma probably just likes clovers, Feather."

10
00:00:40.356 --> 00:00:45.812
Bumble nodded slowly. "And Sprite is right.

11
00:00:45.813 --> 00:00:49.106
We have a job to do."

12
00:00:49.107 --> 00:00:53.489
"Let's get a wishbit," Sprite said.

13
00:00:53.490 --> 00:01:01.032
The fairies followed the smoke to a brick house.

14
00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:04.597
They peeked through a bedroom window.

15
00:01:04.598 --> 00:01:08.634
Four-leaf clover wallpaper covered the walls.

16
00:01:08.635 --> 00:01:11.499
A clover blanket lay on the bed.

17
00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:16.400
A clover balloon floated on a string.

18
00:01:16.401 --> 00:01:25.283
Feather groaned. "Four-leaf clovers are everywhere!"

19
00:01:25.284 --> 00:01:29.741
"Those aren't real clovers," Sprite said.

20
00:01:29.742 --> 00:01:36.477
Hob nodded. "They can't hurt us."

21
00:01:36.478 --> 00:01:42.226
"I don't care!" Feather crossed her arms.

22
00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:45.210
"Fine." Sprite shrugged.

23
00:01:45.211 --> 00:01:49.375
"We'll get a wishbit without you."

24
00:01:49.376 --> 00:01:53.820
She flew inside, and Hob and Bumble followed.

25
00:01:53.821 --> 00:01:58.162
The three fairies looked around the room.

26
00:01:58.163 --> 00:02:02.537
"Everything has a clover on it," Bumble said.

27
00:02:02.538 --> 00:02:05.676
"What should we—"

28
00:02:05.677 --> 00:02:08.447
The door suddenly flew open.

29
00:02:08.448 --> 00:02:11.472
"Hide!" Bumble cried.

30
00:02:11.473 --> 00:02:14.248
The fairies zipped under the bed.

31
00:02:14.249 --> 00:02:20.544
They turned into other shapes.

32
00:02:20.545 --> 00:02:25.739
Emma looked around her room. "There it is!"

33
00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:33.161
She picked up a hat and left.

34
00:02:33.162 --> 00:02:41.288
The fairies turned back into themselves.

35
00:02:41.289 --> 00:02:44.373
Hob flew over to something.

36
00:02:44.374 --> 00:02:50.253
"I found a good wishbit!" he said.

37
00:02:50.254 --> 00:02:53.330
The three fairies flew back to Feather.

38
00:02:53.331 --> 00:02:56.980
"We got the wishbit," Sprite said.

39
00:02:56.981 --> 00:03:02.237
Hob held up a watering can. "No clovers!"

40
00:03:02.238 --> 00:03:07.961
Sprite grinned. "We did all the work.

41
00:03:07.962 --> 00:03:13.276
So you can carry it for us, Feather!"

42
00:03:13.277 --> 00:03:18.441
The fairies flew to the Wish Factory.

43
00:03:18.442 --> 00:03:21.611
"Hi, Blinx," Sprite said.

44
00:03:21.612 --> 00:03:30.528
"We have a wishbit for you."

45
00:03:30.529 --> 00:03:35.508
But Blinx raised his arms and backed away!

